cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ferrotensor in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Ferrotensor: GPU training in Rust on any GPU through WebGPU"
abstract: >-
  Ferrotensor is a Rust machine learning framework that trains and fine-tunes
  models on any GPU through wgpu (Metal, Vulkan, DX12) with hand-written WGSL
  kernels and no CUDA toolchain. It runs LoRA fine-tuning of Llama-style
  language models from 135M to 1.7B parameters, with every kernel checked
  against a CPU reference.
